  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_5_006tsu_1_5_006_01:1_5_006_01:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c391997b55a2964fa0fc166f4cc2e2a84ff43baeb6237ada6e314982654dd101",
      "text": "工作中",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_006tsu_1_5_006_01:1_5_006_01:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5d3e8fa043af75a87dd4faef01ce8885090903c7489ecb33e70005fc16c71c5",
      "text": "【剧情梗概】",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_006tsu_1_5_006_01:1_5_006_01:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33d8451285d4e5f69626e1f5771ddc007ba751ec655f29067561078d2496c78f",
      "text": "工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_006tsu_1_5_006_01:1_5_006_01:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:55059d1f40fc7f8ce7816ee209b4f5195f0d030716e3657f673459d36351f0e7",
      "text": "包装米饭广告的工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_006tsu_1_5_006_01:1_5_006_01:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8845b83402b397cb6f4defab5808f8b0599ed2ee86e35aa5ebc059e9bac1157f",
      "text": "嘿咻……果然好沉啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_006tsu_1_5_006_01:1_5_006_01:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dd8567830d4969dec431caf53e009458b404c96619f1e37531c2a237e4c05f64",
      "text": "哎，●●●●プロデューサー。\n那个行李是怎么回事？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_006tsu_1_5_006_01:1_5_006_01:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ae508f2ee4ec6a4a9dac796d583d99e4b1803664c4e6d5fc0eaa3dcce1584f5",
      "text": "这个吗？是下次翼先生要出演的\n广告合作企业寄过来的哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_006tsu_1_5_006_01:1_5_006_01:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:580950b64fa30f0a97b2adf4f0ad322457c26393a6fbcbe2e7765b2172576888",
      "text": "下次的话就是包装米饭的……也就是说，\n●●●●プロデューサー，好厉害！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_006tsu_1_5_006_01:1_5_006_01:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ffb33a3753b63723598abea9d2c234eb3b4b3faa3b6ba2c4f4fcd5cddac8d7f",
      "text": "除了白米饭还有红豆饭、什锦饭……\n甚至还有大盛分量的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_006tsu_1_5_006_01:1_5_006_01:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c4dc3ad448b01964c231cff7fdc4dedc0a7fe9cba655fcd14f66a9b0c5fd96b0",
      "text": "这里的商品不管是哪一种，都和刚出锅的一样\n好吃呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_006tsu_1_5_006_01:1_5_006_01:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:478cb7710aadb1c676844a74ce37434e83c8775ccd5cf6cb1d2ef6256b9c0e85",
      "text": "第一次吃的时候，我超级惊讶的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_006tsu_1_5_006_01:1_5_006_01:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:12fa3e86bebdb049264915c863ce1bd5a090db058f6609920eb684bbea7118ad",
      "text": "用这个来捏饭团也很美味，\n稍微加工改造一下的话……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_006tsu_1_5_006_01:1_5_006_01:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0244e6835c3e5a9922743513fbfd86c1fbd7d67c968683758a4f92c60c6ef28",
      "text": "哎呀，光是想着米饭的事，\n肚子就饿起来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_006tsu_1_5_006_01:1_5_006_01:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b0a6fe93fdd535c382f5d87cfdf80181d19ee8168f750b51adac8b69d2402b6",
      "text": "呵呵，虽然接下来有开会的安排，\n不过时间还来得及，要先去吃点东西吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
